abstract: >-
  Canonical defensive-publication registry for the Resolutive Technology family.
  Version 0.1.0 records the foundational architecture and scoped experimental
  technical disclosures for Resolutive Memory, trajectory addressing, MA2A
  deterministic state synchronization and organizational PKI, together with
  related experimental families. Complexity, compression, reversibility,
  performance and physical claims are limited to the evidence and operations
  stated in each disclosure.
